[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Type=Application
Name=Send to a nearby device
Name[en]=Send to a nearby device
Name[zh_CN]=发送到附近的设备…
Name[ru]=Отправить на устройство рядом…
Comment=Send this file over Wi-Fi to a LocalSend-compatible device
Comment[zh_CN]=通过 Wi-Fi 把文件发送到兼容 LocalSend 的设备
Comment[ru]=Отправить файл по Wi-Fi на устройство, совместимое с LocalSend
# Offered by the file manager's 「打开方式」 list for a file; not a launcher entry (it needs a file).
# It runs in a terminal window of its own: shabnam-send lists the devices and asks which one.
Exec=foot --app-id=shabnam-send --title=隔空传送 -e shabnam-send --hold %F
Icon=/usr/share/shabnam/icons/drop.png
Terminal=false
NoDisplay=true
StartupWMClass=shabnam-send
Categories=Network;FileTransfer;
MimeType=application/octet-stream;image/png;image/jpeg;image/gif;image/webp;image/svg+xml;image/bmp;application/pdf;text/plain;text/html;audio/mpeg;audio/flac;audio/ogg;audio/x-wav;video/mp4;video/x-matroska;video/webm;application/zip;
